{"content_hash": "8ce3e8b0633b4b6b", "version_id": 885, "article_id": 89, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Nvidia adds DLSS tuning for 19 games in latest App update", "title_zh": "英伟达 App 更新，19 款游戏加入 DLSS 优设", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/023/068.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1719763031152-e9a4bcb12a3e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YXBwJTIwZGxzc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzOTI5NDkwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Indra Projects on Unsplash", "author": "Indra Projects", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@indraprojects?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-computer-screen-with-many-different-app-icons-S4QZnvK5Mvg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(9, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(47, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "0171d0c216a0"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-06", "word_count": 228, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Nvidia has rolled out version 11.0.9.585 of its NVIDIA App, extending one-click DLSS tuning to 19 titles and handing six others new optimal-settings profiles. The release caps a run of updates that has steadily folded more graphics controls into the company's unified software hub.", "lead_zh": "英伟达推出 NVIDIA App 11.0.9.585 版本，把一键 DLSS 优设扩展到 19 款游戏，另外 6 款游戏获得新的最佳设置配置文件。这次更新也延续了近期一连串版本迭代，越来越多图形控制被整合进这个统一软件平台。", "preview": "The headline addition is DLSS tuning for 19 games, among them PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2, AIO", "preview_zh": "本次更新最引人注目的是为 19 款游戏加入 DLSS 优设，其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师 3：狂猎》《龙之信条 2》《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《应征入伍》以及重制版《真·三国无双 2 猛将传》。该功能让玩家直接套用英伟达推荐的 DLSS 配置，无需逐项手动调整，显然是为那些不", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 868, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 105.625, "size_bytes": 634752, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 265, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@535f2a4/content/data/versions/885.json", "paragraphs": ["The headline addition is DLSS tuning for 19 games, among them PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2, AION 2, Aniimo, Enlisted and the remastered Dynasty Warriors 2 Xtreme Legends. The feature lets players apply Nvidia's recommended DLSS configuration without manually adjusting each setting, a convenience aimed squarely at users who would rather not tinker with per-title options.", "A separate group of six titles—AION 2, Aniimo, Control Resonant, EA Sports FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer—receives so-called optimal-settings profiles, which configure a game's graphics options automatically for the installed hardware. Notably, several of these are unreleased or newly announced projects, suggesting Nvidia is now preparing profiles ahead of launch rather than after.", "The 11.0.9.585 build arrives on the heels of two more feature-rich releases. The main 11.0.9 version introduced DLSS 4.5 ray reconstruction alongside per-game Resizable BAR controls, while the interim 11.0.9.565 build added RTX Spark support and telemetry covering CPU clock speed, power draw and temperature. Cumulatively, the updates push the App closer to a single dashboard for driver, display and performance management.", "Users can locate the DLSS tuning options under Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings within the NVIDIA App. The company has not indicated when the next feature update is due, though the cadence of recent releases implies further additions are likely in the near term."], "paragraphs_zh": ["本次更新最引人注目的是为 19 款游戏加入 DLSS 优设，其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师 3：狂猎》《龙之信条 2》《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《应征入伍》以及重制版《真·三国无双 2 猛将传》。该功能让玩家直接套用英伟达推荐的 DLSS 配置，无需逐项手动调整，显然是为那些不想折腾各项参数的用户准备的。", "另有 6 款游戏获得所谓的最佳设置配置文件，包括《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《控制：共振》《EA SPORTS FC 27》《战争机器：事变日》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》，可依据本机硬件自动配置游戏的画面选项。值得注意的是，其中多款尚未发售或刚刚公布，说明英伟达如今倾向于在游戏上市前就备好配置文件，而不是等到发售后。", "11.0.9.585 版本紧跟在两个功能更丰富的版本之后。11.0.9 主版本引入了 DLSS 4.5 光线重建，并加入针对单款游戏的 Resizable BAR 控制选项；随后的 11.0.9.565 版本则新增对 RTX Spark 的支持，并加入 CPU 时钟频率、功耗和温度等统计数据。几次更新叠加起来，让这款 App 越来越接近驱动、显示与性能管理的一站式面板。", "用户可以在 NVIDIA App 的 Graphics（图形）> Program Settings（程序设置）> Driver Settings（驱动程序设置）中找到 DLSS 优设相关选项。英伟达尚未透露下一次功能更新的时间，但从近期的发布节奏看，短期内大概率还会有新功能加入。"], "body": "The headline addition is DLSS tuning for 19 games, among them PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2, AION 2, Aniimo, Enlisted and the remastered Dynasty Warriors 2 Xtreme Legends. The feature lets players apply Nvidia's recommended DLSS configuration without manually adjusting each setting, a convenience aimed squarely at users who would rather not tinker with per-title options.\n\nA separate group of six titles—AION 2, Aniimo, Control Resonant, EA Sports FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer—receives so-called optimal-settings profiles, which configure a game's graphics options automatically for the installed hardware. Notably, several of these are unreleased or newly announced projects, suggesting Nvidia is now preparing profiles ahead of launch rather than after.\n\nThe 11.0.9.585 build arrives on the heels of two more feature-rich releases. The main 11.0.9 version introduced DLSS 4.5 ray reconstruction alongside per-game Resizable BAR controls, while the interim 11.0.9.565 build added RTX Spark support and telemetry covering CPU clock speed, power draw and temperature. Cumulatively, the updates push the App closer to a single dashboard for driver, display and performance management.\n\nUsers can locate the DLSS tuning options under Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings within the NVIDIA App. The company has not indicated when the next feature update is due, though the cadence of recent releases implies further additions are likely in the near term.", "body_zh": "本次更新最引人注目的是为 19 款游戏加入 DLSS 优设，其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》《巫师 3：狂猎》《龙之信条 2》《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《应征入伍》以及重制版《真·三国无双 2 猛将传》。该功能让玩家直接套用英伟达推荐的 DLSS 配置，无需逐项手动调整，显然是为那些不想折腾各项参数的用户准备的。\n\n另有 6 款游戏获得所谓的最佳设置配置文件，包括《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《控制：共振》《EA SPORTS FC 27》《战争机器：事变日》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》，可依据本机硬件自动配置游戏的画面选项。值得注意的是，其中多款尚未发售或刚刚公布，说明英伟达如今倾向于在游戏上市前就备好配置文件，而不是等到发售后。\n\n11.0.9.585 版本紧跟在两个功能更丰富的版本之后。11.0.9 主版本引入了 DLSS 4.5 光线重建，并加入针对单款游戏的 Resizable BAR 控制选项；随后的 11.0.9.565 版本则新增对 RTX Spark 的支持，并加入 CPU 时钟频率、功耗和温度等统计数据。几次更新叠加起来，让这款 App 越来越接近驱动、显示与性能管理的一站式面板。\n\n用户可以在 NVIDIA App 的 Graphics（图形）> Program Settings（程序设置）> Driver Settings（驱动程序设置）中找到 DLSS 优设相关选项。英伟达尚未透露下一次功能更新的时间，但从近期的发布节奏看，短期内大概率还会有新功能加入。", "text": "The headline addition is DLSS tuning for 19 games, among them PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt, Dragon's Dogma 2, AION 2, Aniimo, Enlisted and the remastered Dynasty Warriors 2 Xtreme Legends. The feature lets players apply Nvidia's recommended DLSS configuration without manually adjusting each setting, a convenience aimed squarely at users who would rather not tinker with per-title options. A separate group of six titles—AION 2, Aniimo, Control Resonant, EA Sports FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer—receives so-called optimal-settings profiles, which configure a game's graphics options automatically for the installed hardware. Notably, several of these are unreleased or newly announced projects, suggesting Nvidia is now preparing profiles ahead of launch rather than after. The 11.0.9.585 build arrives on the heels of two more feature-rich releases. The main 11.0.9 version introduced DLSS 4.5 ray reconstruction alongside per-game Resizable BAR controls, while the interim 11.0.9.565 build added RTX Spark support and telemetry covering CPU clock speed, power draw and temperature. Cumulatively, the updates push the App closer to a single dashboard for driver, display and performance management. Users can locate the DLSS tuning options under Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings within the NVIDIA App. The company has not indicated when the next feature update is due, though the cadence of recent releases implies further additions are likely in the near term.", "vocab": [{"word": "roll out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "推出，发布", "note": "常用于软件、服务、产品的分阶段发布", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "extend ... to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "把……扩展到", "note": "说明功能覆盖范围扩大", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cap", "pos": "verb", "zh": "为……画上句号，收尾", "note": "cap a run of updates 意为给一连串更新收尾", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fold into", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "并入，整合进", "note": "fold more controls into a hub", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tinker with", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "摆弄，反复调整", "note": "略带贬义，指琐碎地调试", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "aim squarely at", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "明确针对", "note": "强调目标人群非常明确", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "on the heels of", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "紧跟在……之后", "note": "新闻常用，表示时间上紧随", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "interim", "pos": "adj", "zh": "过渡的，中间的", "note": "interim build 指两次主版本之间的过渡版本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "telemetry", "pos": "noun", "zh": "遥测数据", "note": "硬件监控语境中的常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cumulatively", "pos": "adv", "zh": "累积起来", "note": "用于总结多次变化的总效果", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dashboard", "pos": "noun", "zh": "仪表盘，控制面板", "note": "软件界面中的集中管理页面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cadence", "pos": "noun", "zh": "节奏，频率", "note": "the cadence of releases 发布节奏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "imply", "pos": "verb", "zh": "暗示，意味着", "note": "比 suggest 更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "per-title", "pos": "adj", "zh": "针对单款游戏的", "note": "per- 前缀表示“按……逐一”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T01:44:48.078996", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si":